  "description": "YACMIB crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C154 H122 Dy6 O36,2(C2 H3 N1),2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.613-3.875 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.98-110.97°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C160H136O38N2Dy6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
